  "婚":{"py":"hūn","t":1,"senses":["marriage, to marry"],"sound":["h- : raspier than English h, with friction at the back of the throat.","-un is really -uen : “wun”.","Tone 1 — high and flat, held level near the top of your range."],"words":[{"hz":"结婚","py":"jiéhūn","en":"to get married","mine":true},{"hz":"订婚","py":"dìnghūn","en":"to be engaged","mine":true},{"hz":"离婚","py":"líhūn","en":"to get divorced","mine":true}],"sents":[{"hz":"我姐姐去年结婚了。","py":"Wǒ jiějie qùnián jiéhūn le.","en":"My sister got married last year."}]},
  "子":{"py":"zi","t":5,"senses":["neutral-tone noun suffix, with no meaning of its own"],"sound":["z- : like the ds in “kids”.","-i here is not “ee”. Hold the consonant and add a buzz — almost no vowel at all.","Neutral tone — short and light, with no tone of its own."],"words":[{"hz":"儿子","py":"érzi","en":"son","mine":true},{"hz":"孩子","py":"háizi","en":"child","mine":true},{"hz":"袜子","py":"wàzi","en":"socks","mine":true},{"hz":"裤子","py":"kùzi","en":"pants","mine":true},{"hz":"桌子","py":"zhuōzi","en":"table, desk","mine":true},{"hz":"椅子","py":"yǐzi","en":"chair","mine":true}],"sents":[{"hz":"椅子很舒服。","py":"Yǐzi hěn shūfu.","en":"The chair is comfortable."},{"hz":"独生子 / 独生女","py":"dúshēngzǐ / dúshēngnǚ","en":"only child (son / daughter)","mine":true}],"other":"Read zǐ for 'child, son', as in 儿子 érzi, 独生子 dúshēngzǐ."},
  "学":{"py":"xué","t":2,"senses":["to study, to learn","-ology, a field of study (as a suffix)"],"sound":["x- : like the sh in “sheep”, same flat tongue. Never “ks” or “z”.","-üe : the rounded ü, then “eh”, lips staying rounded.","Tone 2 — rising, like the end of an English question."],"words":[{"hz":"学生","py":"xuésheng","en":"student","mine":true},{"hz":"数学","py":"shùxué","en":"math","mine":true},{"hz":"同学","py":"tóngxué","en":"classmate","mine":true},{"hz":"学习","py":"xuéxí","en":"to study","mine":true},{"hz":"初学者","py":"chūxuézhě","en":"beginner","mine":true},{"hz":"人类学","py":"rénlèixué","en":"anthropology","mine":true},{"hz":"学校","py":"xuéxiào","en":"school"}],"sents":[{"hz":"我在大学学习。","py":"Wǒ zài dàxué xuéxí.","en":"I study at university."},{"hz":"我每天学习三个小时左右。","py":"Wǒ měitiān xuéxí sān gè xiǎoshí zuǒyòu.","en":"I study about three hours a day.","mine":true},{"hz":"我喜欢听音乐和玩音乐，我正在学贝斯吉他，我朋友在教我。","py":"wǒ xǐhuan tīng yīnyuè hé wán yīnyuè, wǒ zhèngzài xué bèisī jítā, wǒ péngyou zài jiāo wǒ.","en":"I like listening to and playing music. I'm learning bass guitar and my friend is teaching me.","mine":true}]},
